    "quote": {
     "url": "https://x.com/HuinGuillaume/status/2113347187694588210",
     "id": "2113347187694588210",
     "text": "The McRib is coming back as early as 10/27 in select McDonald's restaurants across the US.\n\nThe legend says that the McRib first came to life to compensate for... a McNugget shortage issue! Apparently, McNuggets had become so wildly popular that our supply could not keep up with demand. So we needed a new recipe with another protein to give us a bit of time to bring in more McNuggets.\n\nThe McRib was created IN 1981 by René Arend, a Luxembourgish-American chef who became our very first executive \"chef\". \n\nWhat was a temporary solve quickly became a cult classic, with fans begging for its return every year. Funny enough, over the years, the McRib has found new meaning online within the crypto community, as some claim Bitcoin tends to perform well after the McRib makes a comeback, particularly in 2017, 2020, 2021. The joke reached its peak in December 2024 when Bitcoin broke $100,000 for the first time in history on the exact same day the McRib returned to menus.\n\nWelcome back, Legend!",
     "raw_text": {
      "text": "The McRib is coming back as early as 10/27 in select McDonald's restaurants across the US.\n\nThe legend says that the McRib first came to life to compensate for... a McNugget shortage issue! Apparently, McNuggets had become so wildly popular that our supply could not keep up with demand. So we needed a new recipe with another protein to give us a bit of time to bring in more McNuggets.\n\nThe McRib was created IN 1981 by René Arend, a Luxembourgish-American chef who became our very first executive \"chef\". \n\nWhat was a temporary solve quickly became a cult classic, with fans begging for its return every year. Funny enough, over the years, the McRib has found new meaning online within the crypto community, as some claim Bitcoin tends to perform well after the McRib makes a comeback, particularly in 2017, 2020, 2021. The joke reached its peak in December 2024 when Bitcoin broke $100,000 for the first time in history on the exact same day the McRib returned to menus.\n\nWelcome back, Legend!",
